Subject: [PATCH 1/5] winemac.drv, ntdll: Port the D3DMetal integration to Wine
 11.20

Apply the macOS D3DMetal presentation and native GS integration that
Calimocho admitted as engine 170ca (metal-port-10-03 / metal-port-11
source, identical trees). Generated by tools/port_d3dmetal.py from the
LGPL-2.1+ CrossOver 26.3.0 source drop (crossover-sources-26.3.0.tar.gz,
sha256 ac99c8ca4b3848f3e81784135f023df266b61c2345726ea55a50b3e030dd6872)
onto pristine WineHQ wine-11.20 (commit 7298a818).

Portions copyright CodeWeavers, Inc., LGPL-2.1-or-later.
